==================================================
FINAL DESIGN INTENT
==================================================

The final page should feel like:

A young organisation's growing physical archive.

Campaigns are stored in FILES.

Knowledge and teaching materials are stored in BOOKS.

The visitor can visually understand the difference immediately:

FILES = WHAT SAATH HAS DONE

BOOKS = WHAT SAATH TEACHES

And clicking each physical object takes the visitor deeper into the actual work.

Keep it tactile, editorial, youthful and memorable — but restrained enough that Saath still feels credible and serious.